  "originalOptions": "[\"A. Creates an SNS topic that allows SQS subscription endpoints to be added as a parameter on the template.\",\"B. Creates an SNS topic that allows SQS subscription endpoints.\",\"C. Creates an SNS topic and then invokes the call to create an SQS queue with a logical resource name of SQSQueue.\",\"D. Creates an SNS topic and adds a subscription ARN endpoint for the SQS resource created under the logical name SQSQueue.\"]",
